5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's get this sorted so we can give the members a clear answer. I really want us to base the new fees on actual data this time instead of just guessing!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Mio. Having a factual basis will ensure the process is fair and transparent for everyone involved. It's better to be precise.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm with you. Let's stop guessing and look at the real numbers. We need to know exactly what's happening before we decide on the fees.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. To make an informed decision, we should examine the records. I'm interested in the actual workload and the financial history.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! Let's make sure we don't miss anything. I want to see how people are actually using the club and how new members are fitting in. Let's do this!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll start by checking the bank statements on last year's renewals and the last year's ledger of outgoings. I want to see exactly what we have and what we're spending!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be helpful to look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the tally of the sign-in sheets. Understanding the current attendance patterns seems important.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll take the rota against the attendance record and the outgoing treasurer's logged hours. I want to see who's actually doing the work and who's just showing up occasionally.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the minute books from the named-grade years. I want to understand the administrative burden and how we handled these structures in the past.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners! I want to see how people are starting out and why some might not be joining.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great plan! We've covered a lot of ground. Does anyone else think we're missing something, or are we happy with these choices for now?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have a comprehensive list. By looking at both the financial records and the attendance patterns, we should have a clear picture of the club's current state.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm satisfied. We've got the money, the attendance, and the workload covered. Let's just get to the data so we can stop talking in circles and actually fix this.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We have a balanced approach. Let us proceed to the findings so we can evaluate the practical implications of the fee structures we will eventually consider.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm happy too! It's like a treasure hunt for information. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can make the club even better for everyone!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited! Let's dive into the records and see what we find. I'll be waiting to hear what you all discover!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
