24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's get to it. I'm ready to see the truth about who's actually putting in the effort.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
